WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.607
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Debate!

2
00:00:04.907 --> 00:00:07.188
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:07.488 --> 00:00:09.476
Today's topic is Opposites.

4
00:00:10.483 --> 00:00:16.328
Today we practise giving our ideas. There is no wrong answer, but we must say why.

5
00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:18.097
Open!

6
00:00:18.997 --> 00:00:21.185
Open. Your turn!

7
00:00:24.085 --> 00:00:24.947
Open!

8
00:00:25.247 --> 00:00:26.167
Great!

9
00:00:27.183 --> 00:00:28.173
Closed!

10
00:00:29.073 --> 00:00:31.133
Closed. Your turn!

11
00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:35.127
Closed!

12
00:00:35.427 --> 00:00:36.440
Wonderful!

13
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:38.149
Full!

14
00:00:39.049 --> 00:00:41.028
Full. Your turn!

15
00:00:43.928 --> 00:00:44.790
Full!

16
00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:46.103
Super!

17
00:00:47.117 --> 00:00:47.967
Empty!

18
00:00:48.867 --> 00:00:51.171
Empty. Your turn!

19
00:00:54.071 --> 00:00:55.014
Empty!

20
00:00:55.314 --> 00:00:56.373
Excellent!

21
00:00:57.383 --> 00:00:59.847
Which do you like better, Open or Closed?

22
00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:05.740
I like Open because it is fun.

23
00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:07.041
Good reason!

24
00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:11.271
Use because to give a reason. For example:

25
00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:14.116
I like Closed because it is nice.

26
00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:16.068
Your turn!

27
00:01:20.368 --> 00:01:22.832
I like Closed because it is nice.

28
00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:26.492
I think Open is fun. Do you agree?

29
00:01:30.292 --> 00:01:31.920
Yes, I agree!

30
00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:36.579
Be kind when you disagree. Say: I think differently.

31
00:01:37.583 --> 00:01:41.306
Listen to your friends. Take turns. Be polite.

32
00:01:41.606 --> 00:01:43.629
I will try, Ms. Lily!

33
00:01:44.617 --> 00:01:49.094
Great job today, everyone! See you next time. Bye-bye!

34
00:01:49.394 --> 00:01:51.278
Bye-bye!

